Use a named macOS loader for a mapped Steam game

A Steam child normally inherits the launcher identity. Before the existing x86_64 macOS loader path, check the canonical PE path against maps in the Wine prefix. Try the corresponding loader using a separate macOS process identity; use the original path if a map or loader is missing or the spawn fails.

Upstream: not sent.

--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/loader.c
+++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/loader.c
@@ -73,6 +73,9 @@
 # include <libkern/OSCacheControl.h>
 # include "coop_proto.h"
 # include <crt_externs.h>
